        <mxCell id="flow_text" value="①  Student draws in a step box (ink strokes captured)&lt;br&gt;②  Strokes sent to /recognize → MyScript (backend) → LaTeX, shown for Confirm/Edit&lt;br&gt;③  On Check: recognized LaTeX per step sent to /attempts/check&lt;br&gt;④  Each step parsed (SymPy) &amp;amp; expression validated&lt;br&gt;⑤  Correctness checked vs. correct_answer; generic Dutch hint if wrong (no misconception matching yet - 2nd MVP)&lt;br&gt;⑥  Results shown per step (✓/⚠) with hint&lt;br&gt;⑦  Attempt auto-saved via /attempts&lt;br&gt;⑧  Next problem → /problems/random, UI resets" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=11.5;spacing=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
