        <mxCell id="security_text" value="✓  HTTPS for all traffic&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;✓  API keys stored only on backend&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;✓  No raw ink stored by default (store LaTeX only)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;✓  Minimize PII (use student access code)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;⚠  RLS not yet meaningful - backend uses one shared service_role connection (bypasses RLS by design); no per-user auth session exists to key policies on (#51 finding)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12.5;spacing=4;fontColor=#111111;" vertex="1" parent="1">
